; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1765                   ensured by precondition. The compliance of the precondition is check during review.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1766   \COUNTERMEASURE \M [CM_OS_SF_OWNERAPPLICATION_M]
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1767  
