; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1786   \DESCRIPTION    Os_MpSwitch is called with values derived from a ServiceCall object. This object hierarchy is
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1787                   initialized in Os_ServicePrologue. Preconditions ensures, that Os_ServicePrologue is called before.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1788                   The compliance of the precondition is check during review.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\Os\Os_ServiceFunction.c	  1789   \COUNTERMEASURE \N [CM_OS_PRECONDITION_N]
